  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="7.3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIAs">III As</ref> 7.3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Et si [dominus vel] præpositus vel aliquis homo hoc infringat vel abhinc exeat, sit dignus eorum quæ apud Greateleiam dicta sunt, nisi regi [magis] placeat alia iustitia.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if a lord or a reeve or any man breaks this decree or departs from it, he shall suffer the penalties declared at Grately, unless the king prefers to inflict a different penalty.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
